      "value": "@{5f8a26770aaa28611fedd6b6|full_name} No, unfortunately I'm not sure what's triggering it (and the world project in this case is ~100GB).\n\nIf I clear the network ID array, it'll build. But then after working on the world again for a bit it'll happen again until I clear the network IDs list again. I'm seeing more people experiencing this now including someone I happened to mention it to the day before I logged this, but again no obvious trigger. I can point others having the same issue to this post though to see if any of them have narrowed down what's causing it.",
